      cues:['Teenager minimising substance use, anxious about confidentiality \u2014 engage directly, see him alone, clarify confidentiality honestly (GMC 0–18: shared only if risk of serious harm, telling him first where safe).','HEADSS assessment + non-judgemental substance history; actively screen safeguarding \u2014 child exploitation/county lines, abuse, mental health/self-harm.','Assess Gillick competence; harm reduction not lecturing (unknown pills may contain nitazenes — not alone, no alcohol, 999); signpost young people’s substance services (NICE NG64); involve parents/safeguarding if indicated.']
